{"data": [{"author_id": "1810528551680323584", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:15:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113031382314234219"], "id": "2113031382314234219", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Samsung is officially turning to arch-rival TSMC to manufacture its next-generation HBM base dies, and it is happening on TSMC's 3nm line. Supply chain updates today confirm that Nvidia demanded identical performance baselines across all memory vendors.\n\nTo qualify for next-gen", "url": "https://x.com/MRchen881/status/2113031382314234219"}, {"author_id": "739825034642919424", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:13:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113029355618341071", "2113031049139949974"], "id": "2113031049139949974", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 478, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "キャバクラ　「DC」\n\n人気キャスト　NVIDIA 　を筆頭に、TSMC、SKハイニクス、Samsong、ASML、東京エレクトロン、アドバンテスト、キオクシア・・・・　豪華なキャストがそろう人気のお店。\n\n最上位顧客はビッグテック（Microsoft Apple Google Amazon", "url": "https://x.com/knightgiri1/status/2113031049139949974"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113026869448880128", "3_2113026875207634945", "3_2113026880580546560"]}, "author_id": "2000210378274549760", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:57:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113026885580108232"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/luI2B5L6lo", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/kabu_0rekaeru/status/2113026885580108232/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113026869448880128", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/luI2B5L6lo"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/luI2B5L6lo", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/kabu_0rekaeru/status/2113026885580108232/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113026875207634945", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/luI2B5L6lo"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/luI2B5L6lo", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/kabu_0rekaeru/status/2113026885580108232/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113026880580546560", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/luI2B5L6lo"}]}, "id": "2113026885580108232", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5877, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🐸【米国ハイテク/半導体の株価】\n期間: 2026/10/21〜10/22  (終値基準） \n-------------------------------🇺🇲\n好決算の発表されました。ですが市場後株価は明暗が分かれています。\nラムリサーチ：約-5%\nTXN：約+1%\nMETA：約+3%\nIBM：約-1% https://t.co/luI2B5L6lo", "url": "https://x.com/kabu_0rekaeru/status/2113026885580108232"}, {"author_id": "174073808", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:04:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113028602090737733"], "id": "2113028602090737733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 162, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Daily Semi Analytics: Micron's roadmap says skip 4F², bet on 3D DRAM and vertical HBM\n\nOne topic tonight: Micron's technology webinar this morning. The slides answer the question that's been hanging over memory for a year: how does DRAM keep scaling once planar shrinks run out?", "url": "https://x.com/xiangwei36/status/2113028602090737733"}, {"author_id": "1373569238061912069", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:24:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113018677096550434"], "id": "2113018677096550434", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6570, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AIトレンドニュース要点（CTEE記事）\n詳細は該当するCTEE抽出記事Noを参照のこと\n\nI. 先進パッケージ・CPO・テスト：NVIDIAが供給網全体の能力を確保\n\nNVIDIAの能力確保は、GPU製造に加え、\n光エンジン、\n半導体テスト、\nパッケージ基板へ広がっている。", "url": "https://x.com/Nikola_pn2501/status/2113018677096550434"}, {"author_id": "2079187167457239040", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:07:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113014351460209093", "2113014431815004320"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 229, "start": 225, "tag": "HBM"}]}, "id": "2113014351460209093", "public_metrics": {"